  "description": "“Punching and making each other bleed. How can you call that a sport?”\n\nHayul, who had been living a boring and stagnant life, goes through a turning point in her life through her friend Hongmin and coach Sangjun. Mixed Martial Arts, it is a sport that has the memories of her dad, but also the one that led Hayul’s dad into death. Hayul grabs her gloves once again, with a plan to get revenge on Johns Alves, the very person that killed her dad.\n\n“Talent above talents, will Hayul ever be able to break through that wall?”\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=814207), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10046197)",
